#N canvas 0 50 680 380 12;
#X text 20 10 ADI MIDI effect -- a starting point (DEV-10). Notes arrive at [notein] and leave through [noteout] \, before the instrument. This one transposes. Each [adi.param] box is a parameter the host shows \, automates and saves. The host releases what a MIDI effect played when it is bypassed or removed \, so a held note never sticks.;
#X obj 20 110 notein;
#X obj 220 110 adi.param \$0 1 -48 48 12 st int Transpose;
#X obj 20 160 + 12;
#X obj 20 190 clip 0 127;
#X obj 20 230 noteout;
#X connect 1 0 3 0;
#X connect 1 1 5 1;
#X connect 1 2 5 2;
#X connect 2 0 3 1;
#X connect 3 0 4 0;
#X connect 4 0 5 0;
